--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party front-end assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The console's single-page application (ui/) bundles the libraries below
into its build (ui/dist), which is redistributed wherever that build is
served. The console container image (pgtoolbox-console) carries their
licence texts under /licenses/console/.
The other npm dependencies of ui/ are pinned, with their licences, in its
lockfile.

