--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Go dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Go module dependencies are linked into the binary rather than vendored in
this repository. Every release publishes an SPDX SBOM and a licence report
(licenses.csv) generated from the module graph; both are attached to the
GitHub release and the SBOM is also attested to the published image.
